<!-- ClickHouse defaults to listening on [::] (IPv6). Docker Desktop's default bridge
     network here has IPv6 disabled, so every listener fails with
     "DNS error: EAI: Address family for hostname not supported" and the container runs
     while accepting no connections — healthy-looking process, refused port. Pinning to
     IPv4 is the fix the error message itself suggests. -->
<clickhouse>
    <listen_host>0.0.0.0</listen_host>
</clickhouse>
